{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"c7f1767c1b43268bd923bcc305f18697c8e69040252de1277dcdf8bec619c733","occurred_at":"2026-11-22T03:47:06Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[99,102]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/unit-live-binding.py","quoted_text":"DEPENDENCY_RE = re.compile(\n    r\"(?P<directive>Wants|Requires|Requisite|BindsTo|PartOf|Conflicts|\"\n    r\"WantedBy|RequiredBy|Also|Upholds|OnFailure|OnSuccess|Triggers|\"\n    r\"TriggersBy|Unit|Service)\\s*=\\s*(?P<value>.*)\")","reason":"Valid. The dependency regex enumerates systemd [Unit] dependency/lifecycle directives, including PartOf, which has the same stop-propagation effect, but omits StopPropagatedFrom= and PropagatesStopTo=. A co-installed unit declaring StopPropagatedFrom=crq-tick.service is therefore ignored, so the fence stop of crq-tick can also stop that co-tenant. Adding both directives to the regex is the smallest compatible fix.","target":"bdde57a89ce7b0c5a76f70fa323fdf4019d713c8"},"finding_id":"c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442","previous_event_id":"22e6a51f24499e8dcbb83b84f155050bc8051469e6c7b4ceca1e784d33484d17","review_id":"b08452801c153d71823e0063057ca8526a7754e9b9085e055e498d2c928878b1"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:c7b77c93896633be5163f44f39c7843bb564e25079db60acbfaa86176229b442:4f7f43dc598d96d70f2527db97067212e6cdbdb406076521c6c36b89c7c7f9f9"}